{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/46c172d96917a372edc77348db4000d5.poster.avif?t=1765811658\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/46c172d96917a372edc77348db4000d5.webm?t=1765811658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/46c172d96917a372edc77348db4000d5.mp4?t=1765811658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contraxis is a fast-paced arcade roguelite where you capture escaped prisoners in the prison city of Axis. Draw precise circles to bind enemies, summon them back as assists, and chain combos while dodging relentless hazards and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/a9993167d765de01dcb19cdfbe054e0c.poster.avif?t=1765811658\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/a9993167d765de01dcb19cdfbe054e0c.webm?t=1765811658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/a9993167d765de01dcb19cdfbe054e0c.mp4?t=1765811658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every fight challenges you to outmaneuver unpredictable inmates who specialize in unique attack styles \u2014 from brute force charges to projectile storms and screen-filling AOE strikes. Capture enemies mid-battle to turn them into assists, letting you unleash their powers at key moments. Quick reflexes, smart positioning, and creative use of assists are the keys to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/extras/0fdfaab5bf812089c689d5144fc747ba.avif?t=1765811658\" width=1560 height=870 /></span><br>Between battles, spend currency at the shop to grab temporary upgrades, extend your survivability, or enhance your tracing abilities. Earn Influence across runs to unlock permanent rewards, new assists, and harder modes. No two runs play the same, and each victory pushes you deeper into Axis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Axis has erupted in chaos after a mass breakout. As Jay, wielder of the Light, it\u2019s your duty to bring order back by binding escaped prisoners and facing the most dangerous leaders head-on. Each layer reveals new threats, culminating in high-stakes boss battles that test every skill you\u2019ve learned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced tracing combat with unique capture mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summonable assists from every enemy you defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple layers of Axis with escalating difficulty and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary upgrades between battles and permanent unlocks with Influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless score-chasing replayability for roguelite fans</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026160?t=1765811658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/c9bf6c3d048e7bb2b83b39fc958cafbd0d2804c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765811658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026160/3b8